2:14.249" end="2:14.481">would</span> <span begin="2:14.481" end="2:14.638">it</span> <span begin="2:14.638" end="2:15.843">feel</span></p></div><div begin="2:19.086" end="2:33.327" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:19.086" end="2:22.365" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.086" end="2:21.978">我的心脏不会因为快没电而衰</span><span begin="2:21.978" end="2:22.365">减</span></p><p begin="2:22.494" end="2:25.816" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.494" end="2:25.419">我的信仰不会因为世界变而改</span><span begin="2:25.419" end="2:25.816">变</span></p><p begin="2:25.946" end="2:29.128" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.946" end="2:26.189">Time</span> <span begin="2:26.189" end="2:26.394">is</span> <span begin="2:26.394" end="2:26.871">running</span> <span begin="2:26.871" end="2:27.346">out</span> <span begin="2:27.346" end="2:28.580">即将进入新的</span><span begin="2:28.580" end="2:28.828">白</span><span begin="2:28.828" end="2:29.128">天</span></p><p begin="2:29.379" end="2:33.327" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.379" end="2:30.283">跟随我步</span><span begin="2:30.283" end="2:30.790">调</span> <span begin="2:30.790" end="2:32.299">别被忘记在了外</span><span begin="2:32.299" end="2:32.617">面</span> <span begin="2:32.950" end="2:33.327">Yeah</span></p></div><div begin="2:33.629" end="2:46.379" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:33.629" end="2:36.016" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.629" end="2:35.728">坐在右边望向废墟怀</span><span begin="2:35.728" end="2:36.016">念</span></p><p begin="2:36.216" end="2:39.479" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.216" end="2:39.168">没有眼泪依旧情不自禁挥手再</span><span begin="2:39.168" end="2:39.479">见</span></p><p begin="2:39.644" end="2:43.092" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.644" end="2:40.599">曾盘旋在</span><span begin="2:40.599" end="2:40.807">头</span><span begin="2:40.807" end="2:41.244">顶</span><span begin="2:41.244" end="2:41.407">的</span> <span begin="2:41.407" end="2:42.249">被吞进了</spa